C0011.description:
The final global rendered-text truncation can silently remove HARD directives and makes `rendered_text` inconsistent with `packets`, `cid`, and `manifest`.

Location: `compose()`, final global phenotype length cap:
if len(rendered) > transform.max_directive_chars:
    rendered = (
        rendered[: transform.max_directive_chars]
        + "\n[... truncated for model capacity]"
    )
Also related: HARD situation packets are phenotype-transformed before rendering:
if situation:
    situation.text
